// MHLMcpServer_SQL.rc - embeds the SQLite DDL scripts that
// TSystemData_SQLite.CreateSystemTables and TBookCollection_SQLite.CreateCollection
// load via TResourceStream(HInstance, ...). The main app links these through
// Program\MyhomeLibResource.rc; this console project needs its own copy of the
// same two resources under the same names because TResourceStream looks them up
// in the current module (this exe), not in the app's.
CreateSystemDB_SQLite RCDATA "..\..\Program\DAO\SQLite\Resources\CreateSystemDB_SQLite.sql"
CreateCollectionDB_SQLite RCDATA "..\..\Program\DAO\SQLite\Resources\CreateCollectionDB_SQLite.sql"
